1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,691
The Spurs led

2
00:00:00,691 --> 00:00:01,438
the NBA Finals

3
00:00:01,438 --> 00:00:02,458
by twenty-nine points.

4
00:00:02,458 --> 00:00:03,138
And lost.

5
00:00:03,138 --> 00:00:03,852
They hit a Finals

6
00:00:03,852 --> 00:00:04,837
record fourteen threes

7
00:00:04,837 --> 00:00:05,325
in the first

8
00:00:05,325 --> 00:00:05,914
half, and led

9
00:00:05,914 --> 00:00:07,161
by twenty-seven at the break.

10
00:00:07,161 --> 00:00:07,682
Then the Knicks

11
00:00:07,682 --> 00:00:08,452
started chasing.

12
00:00:08,452 --> 00:00:09,290
San Antonio went

13
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:10,163
three for seventeen

14
00:00:10,163 --> 00:00:11,046
from deep in the second

15
00:00:11,046 --> 00:00:11,306
half.

16
00:00:11,306 --> 00:00:12,406
Since nineteen ninety-seven,

17
00:00:12,406 --> 00:00:12,961
nobody had come

18
00:00:12,961 --> 00:00:13,402
