23
00:00:16,484 --> 00:00:16,904
to win it,

24
00:00:16,904 --> 00:00:17,379
and missed.

25
00:00:17,379 --> 00:00:18,489
But OG Anunoby

26
00:00:18,489 --> 00:00:19,396
tipped it in with one

27
00:00:19,396 --> 00:00:20,472
point two seconds left.

28
00:00:20,472 --> 00:00:21,118
A hundred seven

29
00:00:21,118 --> 00:00:21,854
to a hundred six.

30
00:00:21,854 --> 00:00:22,648
The biggest comeback

31
00:00:22,648 --> 00:00:23,520
in Finals history.
